The '''River City Stages''' are a group of stages appearing during certain special events. They were added in the [[Version 10.9 Update]] and introduce several [[:Category:Event Enemies|Event Enemies]].

==Event Information==
Go for glory in a hot-blooded head-to-head! The {{Color|#0000FF|River City Cat Clash'''}} is on now!<br>
New {{Color|#9900FF|'''Uber Rare'''}} unit {{Color|#9900FF|'''Ryuichi'''}} has been added to the {{Color|#FF0000|'''"River City Cat Clash" Capsules,'''}} along with the return of Kunio-kun'''}}!

On from:<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''November 2 (11:00 AM) until November 16, 2026 (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited River City maps available!'''}}<br>
Can you emerge victorious in a host of sports events?!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Clear rewards have been reset!'''}}

Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats in these limited maps!

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Map: "River City Ball-Rolling"'''}}<br>
Clear this stage to earn {{Color|#4A86E8|'''huge XP rewards'''}}!<br>
Take on this stage over and over to reap the huge XP prizes!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#4A86E8|'''XP'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Map: "River City Challenge Course"'''}}<br>
Make your way through the obstacle course in a race to be the fastest!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, battle items'''}}, and more!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This map will appear after clearing stage 1 of "River City Ball-Rolling".<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Map: "River City Relay"'''}}<br>
A set of sequential stages that can be cleared once per day!<br>
Pass the baton and continue to the next challenge!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#4A86E8|'''XP'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This map will appear after clearing stage 1 of "River City Challenge Course".

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Maps "River City Three-Leg Race ① - ③" available starting Day 5 of the event!'''}}<br>
Two-on-two format battle maps await the duo of your choosing!<br>
Claim the Sports Day crown with a single trusted ally!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Cat Ticket, battle items'''}}, and more!

"River City Three-Leg Race ③" can be played after clearing "River City Three-Leg Race ②", and "River City Three-Leg Race ②" can be played after clearing "River City Three-Leg Race ①".

{{Color|#B45F06|'''● Limited Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''River City Cat Clash Special Missions'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, battle items, etc.

{{Color|#0000FF|'''Earn up to 14 River City Cat Clash Event Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, battle items, etc.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must claim rewards from cleared Special missions before the event ends. Even if mission objectives have been met, rewards cannot be claimed after the mission disappears.

For more information on the River City series:<br>
https://www.kuniokun.jp/

