==Trivia==
*The River City Challenge Course stages have the highest enemy limit of all stages, with a whopping 100 max enemies.
*The event poster's announcement of "Kunio-kun joins the fight!" is likely a reference to a similar message stated when unlocking a character in a [[wikipedia:Super Smash Bros.|Super Smash Bros.]] game.
*In the 2023 English event banner, High School Kingpin Riki is absent.

